<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1215corr-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 12 to 15 corrections"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.1.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1215corr-lineage/1.1.0> ;
    owl:priorVersion <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1215corr-lineage/1.0.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1215corr_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.1.0 (2026-11-26): Scope stage only (one stage per version): the scope statement with its areas, deliverables and exclusions, derived from the Mission stage's verified gaps (Lineage Operating Discipline v163.0.7, 3d: the chain is derived from the scope taxonomy). Each area is answered by a goal in the goal stage, each exclusion by a goal that guards it. The three gaps named NOT MEASURED in 1.0.0 are scope items here and are measured, by reading the page's own menu and code, before any goal rests on them."""@en .

